      "fingerprint": "6b3a38008925e3246b1e92ea4a96906e02e9767af7e9b9de73d039caf8d2b4d0",
      "note": "date_limit is a TimeWithZone and limit_for_delete comes from Mconf::Env.fetch_int, which rejects anything but /^\\d+$/ and returns an Integer, so neither can carry SQL. No request data reaches this query. Still worth rewriting with bind parameters."
