    {
      "fingerprint": "6f5239fb87c64764d0c209014deb5cf504c2c10ee424bd33590f0a4f22e01d8f",
      "note": "Deferred, not accepted as safe: config.load_defaults 5.0 leaves default_protect_from_forgery off and no controller calls it, so there is no CSRF protection. Turning it on needs its own analysis, since LTI launches arrive as cross-site POSTs from the LMS and would start failing."
    }
